    "site_desc": "This tower is located at Acton Lake, a eutrophic reservoir immediately surrounded by forest but draining an agricultural watershed in Hueston Woods State Park outside of Oxford, OH. The EC instrumentation was originally deployed 25 m from shore on a dock piling. In April of 2018 a lake tower was installed >200 m from the closest shoreline. The EC instrumentation was deployed on this aquatic tower on 7 May 2018.",
